{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-1","title":"Mark 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jesus is transfigured. 11 He instructs his disciples concerning the coming of Elias; 14 casts forth a deaf and dumb spirit; 30 foretells his death and resurrection; 33 exhorts his disciples to humility; 38 bidding them not to prohibit such as are not against them, nor to give offence to any of the faithful.</p>\n<p>That. Mt 16:28; Lu 9:27 taste. Lu 2:26; Joh 8:51,52; Heb 2:9 the kingdom. Mt 24:30; 25:31; Lu 22:18,30; Joh 21:23; Ac 1:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-2","title":"Mark 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>after. Mt 17:11-13; Lu 9:28-36 Peter. 5:37; 14:33; 2Co 13:1 an high. Ex 24:13; 1Ki 18:42,33; Mt 14:13; Lu 6:12 transfigured. 16:12; Ex 34:29-35; Isa 33:17; 53:2; Mt 17:2; Lu 9:29; Joh 1:14 Ro 12:2; 2Co 3:7-10; Php 2:6-8; 3:21; 2Pe 1:16-18; Re 1:13-17; 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-3","title":"Mark 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>his raiment. Ps 104:1,2; Da 7:9; Mt 28:3; Ac 10:30 exceeding. Ps 51:7; 68:14; Isa 1:18; Re 7:9,14; 19:18 no. Mal 3:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-4","title":"Mark 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>appeared. Mt 11:13; 17:3,4; Lu 9:19,30,31; 24:27,44; Joh 5:39,45-47 Ac 3:21-24; 1Pe 1:10-12; Re 19:10 Elias.Moses was the founder of the Jewish polity, and Elias the most zealous reformer and prophet of the Jewish church; and their presence implied that the ministry of Christ was attested by the law and the prophets.</p>\n<p>2Ki 2:11,12 Elijah. Moses. De 34:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-5","title":"Mark 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>it is. Ex 33:17-23; Ps 62:2,3; 84:10; Joh 14:8,9,21-23; Php 1:23; 1Jo 3:2 Re 22:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-6","title":"Mark 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>16:5-8; Da 10:15-19; Re 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-7","title":"Mark 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>a cloud. Ex 40:34; 1Ki 8:10-12; Ps 97:2; Da 7:13; Mt 17:5-7; 26:64 Lu 9:34-36; Ac 1:9; Re 1:7 This. 1:11; Ps 2:7; Mt 3:17; 26:63; 27:43,54; Joh 1:34,49; 3:16-18 Joh 5:18,22-25,37; 6:69; 9:35; 19:7; 20:31; Ac 8:37; Ro 1:4; 2Pe 1:17 1Jo 4:9,10; 5:11,12,20 hear. Ex 23:21,22; De 18:15-19; Ac 3:22,23; 7:37; Heb 2:1; 12:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-8","title":"Mark 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Lu 9:36; 24:31; Ac 8:39,40; 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-9","title":"Mark 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>he charged. 5:43; 8:29,30; Mt 12:19; 17:9 till. 30,31; 8:31; 10:32-34; Mt 12:40; 16:21; 27:63; Lu 24:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-10","title":"Mark 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>they. Ge 37:11; Lu 2:50,51; 24:7,8; Joh 16:17-19 what. 32; Mt 16:22; Lu 18:33,34; 24:25-27; Joh 2:19-22; 12:16,33,34 Joh 16:29,30; Ac 17:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-11","title":"Mark 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>4; Mal 3:1; 4:5; Mt 11:14; 17:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-12","title":"Mark 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","ref