affirms that he had a \"dumb spirit\" which tare him, that our Lord charged him to \"come out of him,\" etc.</p>\n<p>20; Jude 1:13 gnasheth. Job 16:9; Ps 112:10; Mt 8:12; Ac 7:54 and they. 28,29; 11:23; 2Ki 4:29-31; Mt 17:16,19-21; Lu 9:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-19","title":"Mark 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>O faithless. 16:14; Nu 14:11,22,27; 32:13,14; De 32:20; Ps 78:6-8,22; 106:21-25 Mt 17:17; Lu 9:41; 24:25; Joh 12:27; 20:27; Heb 3:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-20","title":"Mark 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the spirit. 18,26; 1:26; 5:3-5; Job 1:10-12; 2:6-8; Lu 4:35; 8:29; 9:42; Joh 8:44 1Pe 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-21","title":"Mark 9:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>How. 5:25; Job 5:7; 14:1; Ps 51:5; Lu 8:43; 13:16; Joh 5:5,6; 9:1,20,21 Ac 3:2; 4:22; 9:33; 14:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-22","title":"Mark 9:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>if. 1:40-42; Mt 8:2,8,9; 9:28; 14:31 have. 5:19; Mt 15:22-28; 20:34; Lu 7:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-23","title":"Mark 9:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>If. 11:23; 2Ch 20:20; Mt 17:20; 21:21,22; Lu 17:6; Joh 4:48-50; 11:40 Ac 14:9; Heb 11:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-24","title":"Mark 9:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>with. 2Sa 16:12; *marg: 2Ki 20:5; Ps 39:12; 126:5; Jer 14:17; Lu 7:38,44; Ac 10:19,31 2Co 2:4; 2Ti 1:4; Heb 5:7; 12:17 help. Lu 17:5; Eph 2:8; Php 1:29; 2Th 1:3,11; Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-25","title":"Mark 9:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>he rebuked. 1:25-27; 5:7,8; Zec 3:2; Mt 17:18; Lu 4:35,41; 9:42; Jude 1:9 thou.If this had been only a natural disease, as some have contended, could our Lord with any propriety have thus addressed it? If the demoniacal possession had been false, or merely a vulgar error, would our Lord, the Revealer of truth, have thus established falsehood, sanctioned error, or encouraged deception, by teaching men to ascribe effects to the malice and power of evil spirits, which they had no agency in producing? Impossible! Such conduct is utterly unworthy the sacred character of the Redeemer.</p>\n<p>Isa 35:5,6; Mt 9:32,33; 12:22; Lu 11:14 I charge. Lu 8:29; Ac 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-26","title":"Mark 9:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>cried. 18,20; 1:26; Ex 5:23; Re 12:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-27","title":"Mark 9:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>1:31,41; 5:41; 8:23; Isa 41:13; Ac 3:7; 9:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-28","title":"Mark 9:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>asked. 4:10,34; Mt 13:10,36; 15:15 Why. Mt 17:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-29","title":"Mark 9:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>This. Mt 12:45; Lu 11:26 by prayer. 1Ki 17:20-22; 2Ki 4:33,34; Mt 17:21; Ac 9:40,41; 2Co 12:8; Eph 6:18 Jas 5:15 fasting. Da 9:3; Ac 14:23; 1Co 9:27; 2Co 6:5; 11:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-30","title":"Mark 9:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>through. Mt 27:22,23 he. 6:31,32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-31","title":"Mark 9:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>The Son. 12; 8:31; Mt 16:21; 20:18,19,28; 21:38,39; 26:2; Lu 9:44; 18:31-33 Lu 24:26,44-46; Joh 2:19; 3:14; 10:18; Ac 2:23,24; 4:27,28 2Ti 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-32","title":"Mark 9:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>they. 10; Lu 2:50; 9:45; 18:34; 24:45 were. 7:18; 8:17,18,33; 16:14; Joh 4:27; 16:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-33","title":"Mark 9:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>he came. Mt 17:24 What. 2:8; Ps 139:1-4; Joh 2:25; 21:17; Heb 4:13; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-34","title":"Mark 9:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>they had. Mt 18:1-5; 20:21-24; Lu 9:46-48; 22:24-30; Ro 12:10; Php 2:3-7 1Pe 5:3; 3Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-35","title":"Mark 9:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>If. 10:42-45; Pr 13:10; Jer 45:5; Mt 20:25-28; Lu 14:10,11; 18:14 Jas 4:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-36","title":"Mark 9:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>10:16; Mt 18:2; 19:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-37","title":"Mark 9:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>receive one. Mt 10:40-42; 18:3-5,10; 25:40; Lu 9:48 receive me. Lu 10:16; Joh 5:23; 10:30; 12:44,45; 14:21-23; 1Th 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-38","title":"Mark 9:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Master. Nu 11:26-29; Lu 9:49,50; 11:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-39","title":"Mark 9:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Forbid. 10:13,14; Mt 13:28,29; Php 1:18 there. Mt 7:22,23; Ac 19:13-16; 1Co 9:27; 13:1,2 lightly. 1Co 12:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-40","title":"Mark 9:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>Mt 12:30; Lu 11:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-41","title":"Mark 9:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>whosoever. Mt 10:42; 25:40 because. Joh 19:25-27; Ro 8:9; 14:15; 1Co 3:23; 15:23; 2Co 10:7; Ga 3:29; 5:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-42","title":"Mark 9:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>offend. Mt 18:6,10; Lu 17:1,2; Ro 14:13; 15:21; 16:17; 1Co 8:10-13 1Co 10:32,33; 2Co 6:3; Php 1:10; 1Ti 5:14; 2Pe 2:2 it. Mt 25:45,46; Ac 9:4; 26:11-14; 2Th 1:6-9; Re 6:9,10; 16:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-43","title":"Mark 9:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>if. De 13:6-8; Mt 5:29,30; 18:8,9; Ro 8:13; 1Co 9:27; Ga 5:24; Col 3:5 Tit 2:12; Heb 12:1; 1Pe 2:1 offend thee. or, cause thee to offend: and so. 45,47 maimed. Mt 15:30,31; Lu 14:13,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-44","title":"Mark 9:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>their. 46,48; Isa 66:24 the fire. Isa 33:14; Mt 3:12; 25:41,46; 2Th 1:9; Re 14:10,11; 20:10,15; 21:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-45","title":"Mark 9:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>43,44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-46","title":"Mark 9:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>Lu 16:24-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-47","title":"Mark 9:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>thine. Ge 3:6; Job 31:1; Ps 119:37; Mt 5:28,29; 10:37-39; Lu 14:26; Ga 4:15 Php 3:7,8 offend thee. or, cause thee to offend. 43; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-48","title":"Mark 9:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>44,46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-49","title":"Mark 9:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>and every. Le 2:13; Eze 43:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mrk-9-50","title":"Mark 9:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MRK","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>is good. Job 6:6; Mt 5:13; Lu 14:34,35 Have salt. Eph 4:29; Col 4:6 have peace. Ps 34:14; 133:1; Joh 13:34,35; 15:17,18; Ro 12:18; 14:17-19 2Co 13:11; Ga 5:14,15,22; Eph 4:2-6,31,32; Php 1:27; 2:1-3 Col 3:12; 2Ti 2:22; Heb 12:14; Jas 1:20; 3:14-18; 1Pe 3:8</p>"}]}